    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/bf15d7021aa7f9cb867641fa26d65aa7.poster.avif?t=1748827899\" width=400 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/bf15d7021aa7f9cb867641fa26d65aa7.webm?t=1748827899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/bf15d7021aa7f9cb867641fa26d65aa7.mp4?t=1748827899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a cute retro-fantasy world and battle alongside your companions in this emotionally charged Turn-Based + Bullet Hell RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/3c81029eec1ba9153ff8323883a4acc2.webp?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=6 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/1878c45dbf9999894bbad2d90bbbf051.webp?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide range of exploration with a plethora of side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-rich story with fleshed-out character arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames for extra rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic Chiptune Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows 98 Webcore Nostalgia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do what <strong>she</strong> says</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/3c81029eec1ba9153ff8323883a4acc2.webp?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=6 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/2601ad2376b5d42f56dff009c1bb2c1f.webp?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/fc27e4f3a25d4715ece99346044ecd81.poster.avif?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/fc27e4f3a25d4715ece99346044ecd81.webm?t=1748827899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-Member Party System in Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Abilities come at the cost of another character's health (Worth instead of Health)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Bullet-Hell Platforming for Enemy Turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal damage by clicking as many times as possible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/3c81029eec1ba9153ff8323883a4acc2.webp?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=6 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/c80593fe033642c21056a0bd18b68b1e.webp?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/73bf8fe5b68a73d415a5db46e4f88dd4.poster.avif?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/73bf8fe5b68a73d415a5db46e4f88dd4.webm?t=1748827899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of 4 friends race against <u>Tree monsters, Food creatures, Whacky snowmen, Sci-Fi computers, Gambling kings and who-knows-what</u>\u00a0to obtain a magical object that can grant anyone their <strong>Deepest Desire...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, something tells you a <strong>certain friend\u00a0</strong>isn't who they seem...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanning 9 Chapters (Kinda), Immortal Boy delves into the perspective of a Boy trapped in a psychological prison created by his own self-esteem and self-perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into Themes of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insecurity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional Manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional Attachment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters being stupid for no reason in particular</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/730060d10b361fbd45bc0e62ac5d7738.avif?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/3c81029eec1ba9153ff8323883a4acc2.webp?t=1748827899\" width=616 height=6 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LATEST PROGRESS REPORT (4 April 2025):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/47926052a0d07d3a6735edf8d88a8873.avif?t=1748827899\" data-has-big width=800 height=524 /></span></p>",
